BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:4th Annual Art at Anthem Holiday Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261214
DTSTAMP:20261121T180622Z
UID:af6cb8b8bfcb81b3732f6c22@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Make holiday memories at the 4th Annual Art at Anthem Holiday 
 Arts Festival\, December 11–13\, 2026\, at Outlets North Phoenix! Spend 
 the day discovering unique\, handcrafted treasures from more than 60 jurie
 d artisans\, with everything from original paintings and photography to cu
 stom pottery\, handcrafted jewelry and authentic Native American art. Whet
 her you’re searching for a special gift or treating yourself to somethin
 g beautiful\, you’ll find plenty of one-of-a-kind pieces to love. Enjoy 
 a festive weekend filled with live music\, delicious food\, face painting\
 , balloon tricks\, train rides and gourmet cookies for the whole family. T
 ake in the magic of Arizona’s tallest fresh-cut Christmas tree while soa
 king up the sights\, sounds and spirit of the season. It’s the perfect w
 ay to enjoy holiday shopping\, support talented artisans and make lasting 
 memories with family and friends. Admission and parking are free! For more
